title: Live_Node
when: always
tags: #hub #reach
subtitle: 开场直播节点
tracking: always
---
/* 游戏本体 · 直播间节点：Live_Node */
<<declare $Fan_Join = false>>
<<StartDanmaku>>
Speaker: 嗨，大家好。欢迎来到本游戏的直播间。 #line:0630975 #state:Idle
Echo: 「今晚的灯，好像比昨天亮。」 #line:0630976 #state:Smile
<<wait 2>> // 给弹幕一点时间滚过屏幕
<<if $Fan_Join>>
  Speaker: 你回来了。 #line:0630977 #state:Idle
  <<jump Live_Hub>>
<<elseif $Trust > 3>>
  Speaker: 先别急着走。 #line:0630978 #state:Serious
  <<set $Fan_Join = true>>
<<else>>
  <<EmitDanmakuTypeBurst "Welcome" 20>>
<<endif>>
-> 继续观看
   Speaker: 那就再坐一会儿吧。 #line:0630979 #state:Idle
-> 转身离开
   Speaker: 晚安。 #line:0630980 #state:Idle
===
